{
  "version": 1,
  "operation": "SdpaBackward",
  "description": "SDPA backward with a long key sequence (1025 to 65536) and few query rows over hipkernel:flydsl_sdpa_bwd_split on gfx942 and gfx90a: a softmax row over Skv keys has probabilities near 1/Skv, below 2**-14 (6.1e-5) from Skv = 16384, where the MFMA of gfx90a flushes fp16 subnormal operands (COVERAGE.md: fp16 divergence). Data half, bfloat16 or float; masks none, bottom-right causal and windows with bounds far from the tile edges; domains as SdpaBackward/FlydslBwdSplit. The cost ceiling is 2**27.",
  "engine": "hipkernel:flydsl_sdpa_bwd_split",
  "template": "../../integration-test-bundles/quick/SdpaBackward/Default/graph.template.json",
  "axes": {
    "dtype": {
      "values": [
        "half",
        "bfloat16",
        "float",
        "half"
      ]
    },
    "layout": {
